    "title": "Browns Dam Road to be closed and detoured - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Community Contributors ,\n15 hours ago The Pennsylvania Department of Transportation (PennDOT) announced today that drainage work will begin next week on a section of Route 94 (Carlisle Pike) in Adams County. This work is part of a 3.8-mile pavement repair and resurfacing project on Route 94 between Pine Run Road in Hamilton Township and Route 234 in Reading Township. Read full article\n1",
